            <div class="container"><div class="hero-content"><span class="hero-pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-earth-africa"></i> Authentic Uganda journeys</span><h1>Go wild in the <span>Pearl of Africa.</span></h1><p>From misty gorilla forests and roaring waterfalls to cultural festivals and open savannahs, experience Uganda through journeys designed with care.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#packages">Explore safaris <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="#destinations"><i class="fa-regular fa-circle-play"></i> Discover Uganda</a></div><div class="hero-note"><span><i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield"></i> Expert local guides</span><span><i class="fa-solid fa-route"></i> Tailor-made itineraries</span><span><i class="fa-solid fa-leaf"></i> Responsible travel</span></div></div></div>
        </section>
        <div class="stats"><div class="container"><div class="stats-grid"><div class="stat"><strong>10</strong><span>National parks</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>1,000+</strong><span>Bird species</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>4</strong><span>Great ape experiences</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>365</strong><span>Days of adventure</span></div></div></div></div>
        <section class="planning" id="planning"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow"><i class="fa-regular fa-compass"></i> Easy trip planning</span><h2>From first idea to unforgettable journey</h2><p>A simple, personal planning process keeps every safari clear, comfortable, and shaped around you.</p></div><div class="planning-grid"><article class="planning-step"><span class="planning-number">01</span><h3>Share your dream</h3><p>Tell us your dates, interests, group size, and preferred travel style.</p></article><article class="planning-step"><span class="planning-number">02</span><h3>Receive your plan</h3><p>We shape a practical route with handpicked experiences and accommodation.</p></article><article class="planning-step"><span class="planning-number">03</span><h3>Confirm securely</h3><p>Review the details, ask questions, and reserve your journey through our booking page.</p></article><article class="planning-step"><span class="planning-number">04</span><h3>Travel with confidence</h3><p>Meet your local team and enjoy responsive support throughout your Uganda adventure.</p></article></div></div></section>
        <section class="experience" id="experiences"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-binoculars"></i> Signature experiences</span><h2>Journeys that stay with you</h2><p>Explore Uganda's remarkable landscapes through thoughtfully planned wildlife, adventure and cultural experiences.</p></div><div class="card-grid">
            <article class="experience-card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540573133985-87b6da6d54a9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=82" alt="Primate in Uganda forest"><div class="card-body"><div class="card-kicker"><span>Primate encounter</span><i class="fa-solid fa-tree"></i></div><h3>Gorilla Trekking</h3><p>Walk through the ancient rainforest of Bwindi for a respectful encounter with mountain gorillas.</p><a class="card-link" href="#packages">View journey <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></div></article>
            <article class="experience-card"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504173010664-32509aeebb62?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=82" alt="Elephants on an African safari"><div class="card-body"><div class="card-kicker"><span>Classic safari</span><i class="fa-solid fa-paw"></i></div><h3>Savannah Wildlife</h3><p>Track elephants, lions, giraffes and buffalo across Queen Elizabeth and Murchison Falls.</p><a class="card-link" href="#destinations">See destinations <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></div></article>
